{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>וירא, את מזורו</b> — a wound that requires bandaging." "<b>וישלח</b> — Judah, for so it is after it." "<b>ירב</b> — a place name in Assyria." "<b>יגהה</b> — like 'he will do good'; גהה from the appearance of the eye."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:18.849542810Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}